\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {2}{\ignorespaces Pan-dementia AlphaGenome stop-gain splicing attribution atlas and saturation dissection of the \textit  {PSEN1} Exon 4--Intron 4 boundary. \textbf  {(A)} Distribution of \texttt  {fi\_MERGED\_SPLICING} scores across all 1,092 MANE Select stop-gain SNVs, highlighting high-impact pseudo-LoF candidates in \textit  {PSEN1} (p.R308*, p.S102*, p.K109*, p.Q29*), \textit  {PSEN2} (p.W47*), \textit  {APP} (p.Y321*), and \textit  {MAPT} (p.G725*) against the ceiling of \textit  {GRN} (max 0.507). \textbf  {(B)} Per-position maximum AlphaGenome splicing attribution across all 108 possible SNVs spanning \textit  {PSEN1} Exon 4 ($-27$\,nt to $-1$\,nt) and Intron 4 ($+1$\,nt to $+9$\,nt), demonstrating that \textit  {PSEN1} p.K109* (0.7569, Phred 51.28) produces the strongest exonic signal while the proximal cryptic donor p.Q112* scores near baseline (0.0737). Shaded green window indicates the optimized 22-mer ASO steric window avoiding canonical \texttt  {+1/+2\,GU}.}}{7}{figure.2}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:fig2}{{2}{7}{Pan-dementia AlphaGenome stop-gain splicing attribution atlas and saturation dissection of the \textit {PSEN1} Exon 4--Intron 4 boundary. \textbf {(A)} Distribution of \texttt {fi\_MERGED\_SPLICING} scores across all 1,092 MANE Select stop-gain SNVs, highlighting high-impact pseudo-LoF candidates in \textit {PSEN1} (p.R308*, p.S102*, p.K109*, p.Q29*), \textit {PSEN2} (p.W47*), \textit {APP} (p.Y321*), and \textit {MAPT} (p.G725*) against the ceiling of \textit {GRN} (max 0.507). \textbf {(B)} Per-position maximum AlphaGenome splicing attribution across all 108 possible SNVs spanning \textit {PSEN1} Exon 4 ($-27$\,nt to $-1$\,nt) and Intron 4 ($+1$\,nt to $+9$\,nt), demonstrating that \textit {PSEN1} p.K109* (0.7569, Phred 51.28) produces the strongest exonic signal while the proximal cryptic donor p.Q112* scores near baseline (0.0737). Shaded green window indicates the optimized 22-mer ASO steric window avoiding canonical \texttt {+1/+2\,GU}}{figure.2}{}}
